{"message": "Fixed the inverted devicetree dependency condition in `/zephyrproject/zephyr/drivers/sensor/adi/adltc2990/Kconfig` (`depends on !DT_HAS_ADI_ADLTC2990_ENABLED` -> `depends on DT_HAS_ADI_ADLTC2990_ENABLED`).

Because of the inverted condition, `CONFIG_ADLTC2990` (and consequently `CONFIG_I2C` and `CONFIG_EMUL_ADLTC2990`) was disabled whenever a devicetree node with compatible `"adi,adltc2990"` was enabled, causing the `I2C_LOG_LEVEL_WRN` Kconfig warning and preventing the driver include directory containing `adltc2990_emul.h` from being added to the build.

After fixing `drivers/sensor/adi/adltc2990/Kconfig`, the build succeeds without warnings and all test suites in `tests/drivers/sensor/adltc2990` pass on `native_sim`.", "kind": "FinishAction"}

